ADBE.d.revenue.2024-11-30.2025-11-28","ADBE.d.revenue.2024-11-30.2025-08-29","ADBE.d.revenue.2025-11-29.2026-02-27","ADBE.d.revenue.2026-02-28.2026-05-29","ADBE.d.revenue.2026-05-30.2026-08-28","ADBE.d.opinc.2024-11-30.2025-11-28","ADBE.d.opinc.2024-11-30.2025-08-29","ADBE.d.opinc.2025-11-29.2026-02-27","ADBE.d.opinc.2026-02-28.2026-05-29","ADBE.d.opinc.2026-05-30.2026-08-28","ADBE.d.netinc.2024-11-30.2025-11-28","ADBE.d.netinc.2024-11-30.2025-08-29","ADBE.d.netinc.2025-11-29.2026-02-27","ADBE.d.netinc.2026-02-28.2026-05-29","ADBE.d.netinc.2026-05-30.2026-08-28"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $10.6 billion: operating cash flow of $10.8 billion less capital spending of $214 million (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["ADBE.d.ocf.2024-11-30.2025-11-28","ADBE.d.ocf.2024-11-30.2025-08-29","ADBE.d.ocf.2025-11-29.2026-02-27","ADBE.d.ocf.2025-11-29.2026-05-29","ADBE.d.ocf.2025-11-29.2026-08-28","ADBE.d.capex.2024-11-30.2025-11-28","ADBE.d.capex.2024-11-30.2025-08-29","ADBE.d.capex.2025-11-29.2026-02-27","ADBE.d.capex.2025-11-29.2026-05-29","ADBE.d.capex.2025-11-29.2026-08-28"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The proxy statement filed 2026-02-27 gives the principal executive officer’s total pay for FY2025 as $51.2 million in its summary compensation table, and the “compensation actually paid” - the SEC’s measure, which revalues share awards over the year - as -$17.4 million.","cites":["ADBE.pay.peoTotal.2025","ADBE.pay.peoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"For the other named executive officers the same table gives an average of $16.9 million in total and -$245230 actually paid.","cites":["ADBE.pay.neoTotal.2025","ADBE.pay.neoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The table puts the value of $100 held in the company’s shares over the years it covers at $67.11 at the end of FY2025, and $187.96 for the peer group the company chose.","cites":["ADBE.pay.tsr.2025","ADBE.pay.peerTsr.2025"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $22.5 billion at the end of FY2025, against $20 billion a year earlier. That is 94.7% of FY2025 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["ADBE.rpo.2025","ADBE.rpo.2024","ADBE.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $7 billion at the end of FY2025 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiability), against $6.3 billion a year earlier.","cites":["ADBE.deferred.2025","ADBE.deferred.2024"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 31,360 in its own words. FY2025 revenue works out to about $758,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["ADBE.q.employees","ADBE.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2025 the balance sheet carried $5.4 billion in cash and cash equivalents and $1.2 billion in short-term investments, and $6.2 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebt). Cash and short-term investments exceeded that debt by $385 million (computed from three filed figures).","cites":["ADBE.cash.2025","ADBE.sti.2025","ADBE.debtTotal.2025"]}]},"fin":{"ADBE":{"insiders":{"from":"2025-11-23","to":"2026-11-23","complete":true,"listed":65,"read":65,"other":0,"failed":0,"odd":0,"people":[["NARAYEN SHANTANU","Chair and CEO, director"],["Forusz Jillian","SVP & CAO"],["Ricks David A","Director"],["Durn Daniel","EVP & CFO"]],"rows":[["S",0,125000,31344876.21,"2026-09-16","2026-09-17","0001224154-26-000003","2026-09-18",0],["S",1,416,109961.28,"2026-07-29","2026-07-29","0000796343-26-000137","2026-07-31",0],["P",2,10000,1945130,"2026-06-25","2026-06-25","0000796343-26-000118","2026-06-26",0],["S",1,755,185914.98,"2026-04-30","2026-04-30","0000796343-26-000107","2026-05-01",0],["S",0,75000,18265234.27,"2026-04-28","2026-04-28","0000796343-26-000105","2026-04-30",0],["S",3,1336,331354.85,"2026-04-20","2026-04-20","0000796343-26-000103","2026-04-22",0],["S",3,1646,485323.26,"2026-01-27","2026-01-27","00007